          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does Kaged whey isolate contain sucralose?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, in the flavors we found. Kaged sweetens its isolate with stevia and sucralose, and taste reviews describe it as very sweet. If you avoid sucralose, BPN's isolate uses stevia only and is NSF Certified for Sport."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much protein is in Kaged whey isolate?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "25 g per scoop of about 34 g, per the label at the time of writing, with about 110 to 130 calories and around 1 g of sugar depending on flavor. A 3 lb tub holds roughly 40 servings, varying a little by flavor."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does Kaged protein contain lactose?",
