            Kaged Whey Protein Isolate is a lean, Informed Sport certified isolate with 25 g of protein per scoop and an added enzyme, at a fair price of about $1.45 to $1.50 per 25 g in a 3 lb tub. Its testing answers the trust question well.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
